+
+## What was done
+
+- `src/index.ts`: `resolvePointer`, `parsePointer` and `JsonPointerError`, with doc comments.
+- `test/json-pointer.test.ts`: written first (red), then green — all RFC 6901 section 5 examples,
+  escape order (`~01`), falsy values, primitive documents, invalid pointers (no leading `/`, bad `~`
+  escapes, non-string, fragment form), missing/inherited members, malformed/out-of-range/`-` array
+  indexes, traversal through primitives, error shape, and `parsePointer` tokens. 14 tests pass with
+  `npm test`; `tsc --noEmit` passes.
+- `README.md`: usage and error behaviour documented, plus how to run tests.
+- Design choices recorded in dl-001-json-pointer-api-string-form-only-jsonpointererror-strict-array-indexes.
